    <note id="bqj">
      <content>
        <p>OpenGame is a world simulation and forecasting engine. We build a living digital twin of a community, run its future forward thousands of times, and inject decisions and rumors to see what happens next. The game is just the visible skin; the core product is the ability to predict and steer real-world outcomes before they happen. Over the next few minutes I will cover the problem, our technology, the business model, and why we are positioned to win.</p>
